{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_01",
      "hash": "3d47d4f9e0a468a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]『おッ　[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_02",
      "hash": "3d47d1f9e0a46388",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]も　助手さん　から\\nカガヤキ　教えて　もらった？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_03",
      "hash": "3d47d2f9e0a4653b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……え？　[VAR TRNAME(0000)]じゃ　なくて\\n[VAR PKNICK(0003)]が　覚えた！？\\c\\n相変わらず　スゴいな\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]の　相棒……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_10",
      "hash": "3d4b59f9e0a78077",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "あッ！　カガヤキ　使えそうな　とこ\\nオレ　知ってるぜ！\\r\\n近くまで　連れてって　やろっか？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_01",
      "hash": "7d683be3eb91c217",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "一緒に　行く"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_02",
      "hash": "7d683ce3eb91c3ca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "一人で　行く"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_04",
      "hash": "3d47d7f9e0a46dba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "おー　今すぐ\\n連れてって　やるよ！\\c\\n行こうぜ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_05",
      "hash": "3d47d8f9e0a46f6d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "ここ　ハナダシティ　から\\n東……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_06",
      "hash": "3d47d5f9e0a46a54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "こっちの　ほうな！\\c\\nこっちに　ずーっと　行くと\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]イワヤマトンネル[VAR COLOR(0000)]　っていう\\r\\n真っ暗な　所が\\r\\nある　らしいんだ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_07",
      "hash": "3d47d6f9e0a46c07",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "カガヤキで　照らせば\\n暗い所も　怖くないぞ！\\c\\nじゃあなー！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_08",
      "hash": "3d47cbf9e0a45956",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "えー！　そっか\\c\\n……ほんとに　大丈夫か？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_03",
      "hash": "7d683de3eb91c57d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "一人で　行きたい"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_04",
      "hash": "7d6836e3eb91b998",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "やっぱり　一緒に"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_09",
      "hash": "3d47ccf9e0a45b09",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "わかった！　一応　言っとくと\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]ハナダシティ[VAR COLOR(0000)]　から\\nずっと　東に　いくと\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]イワヤマトンネル[VAR COLOR(0000)]　っていう\\n真っ暗な　所が　あるんだって！\\c\\n気をつけて　いけよ！\\nじゃあなー！"
    }
  ],
